	"_doc": "Non-state music, the rite, the state wave, region ambience layers, footstep ground, strike surfaces, foe families and the effect registry. Per-state music and the base ambience bed live in state_profiles.json. The 'sfx' block is generated by tools/audio/build_sfx.py; everything else is authored here. Sources and measurements: docs/audio/SFX.md.",
